# Pharmacy catalog suggestions

The product card datalist (manufacturer, dosage form, ATC) comes from `GET /pharmacy/products/suggestions`. That query returns at most 200 distinct attribute values per field for the current company.

Do not restore `fetchAllPharmacyProductPages` or walk every product page to fill those lists. A full catalog in the browser freezes the admin.
